   <Part id="3">
      <Description done="no">You must seek the final globe containing the Spirit Lord&apos;s Essence. Location: %s.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="yes">You have slain the final guardian and recovered the final globe.  The Spirit Lord himself has joined your army.</Description>
      <Description done="yes" first="no">Alas!  The third guardian was dead, and the globe gone.  Without it, you will never be able to call upon the Spirit Lord.</Description>
      <Success first="yes">You have slain the final guardian and found the final globe containing the Spirit Lord&apos;s essence.</Success>
      <Success first="no">The guardian is already dead, and the final globe is nowhere to be found.</Success>
      <Reward type="allies" unit="43" level="20" number="1" name="Spirit Lord">With all 4 globes present, you finally call upon the Spirit Lord.  Grateful for his freedom, he offers to join you.</Reward>
      <Monster type="35" number="1" level="15"/>
   </Part>
</Quest>
